    "code": "\\begin{tikzpicture}[\n        node distance=0.75cm,\n        every node/.style={font=\\small}\n        ]\n\n        \\node[\n        draw,\n        rounded corners,\n        fill=IdeaBody,\n%        text width=2.2cm,\n        align=center,\n        minimum height=0.9cm\n        ] (form) {\n            Formulario\n        };\n\n        \\node[\n        draw,\n        rounded corners,\n        fill=QuestionBody,\n        right=of form,\n%        text width=2.2cm,\n        align=center,\n        minimum height=0.9cm\n        ] (submit) {\n            \\texttt{submit}\n        };\n\n        \\node[\n        draw,\n        rounded corners,\n        fill=WarningBody,\n        right=of submit,\n%        text width=2.6cm,\n        align=center,\n        minimum height=0.9cm\n        ] (prevent) {\n            \\texttt{preventDefault()}\n        };\n\n        \\node[\n        draw,\n        rounded corners,\n        fill=PracticeBody,\n        right=of prevent,\n%        text width=2.2cm,\n        align=center,\n        minimum height=0.9cm\n        ] (validate) {\n            Validar\n        };\n\n        \\node[\n        draw,\n        rounded corners,\n        fill=ResultBody,\n        right=of validate,\n%        text width=2.2cm,\n        align=center,\n        minimum height=0.9cm\n        ] (result) {\n            Responder\n        };\n\n        \\draw[-{Latex[length=2.5mm]}, thick] (form) -- (submit);\n        \\draw[-{Latex[length=2.5mm]}, thick] (submit) -- (prevent);\n        \\draw[-{Latex[length=2.5mm]}, thick] (prevent) -- (validate);\n        \\draw[-{Latex[length=2.5mm]}, thick] (validate) -- (result);\n\n    \\end{tikzpicture}"
